# CQ: What human oversight measures referred to in Article 14 are put in place in the high-risk AI system?
# Question: lexreq:aiact-art13-3-d-cq1
# Requirement: lexreq:aiact-art13-3-d
# Terms: aidoc:HumanOversightMechanism, aidoc:hasHumanOversight

PREFIX aidoc: <https://w3id.org/aidoc-ap#>
SELECT ?system ?measure ?type WHERE {
  ?system aidoc:hasHumanOversight ?measure .
  ?measure a ?type .
}
